1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,703
As Uke comes to grab your wrist

2
00:00:02,704 --> 00:00:06,013
extend the opposite arm towards his face 
to distract him

3
00:00:06,014 --> 00:00:08,059
moving the body diagonally backwards

4
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,009
cut down drawing his body towards you,

5
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,298
as he do so

6
00:00:11,299 --> 00:00:14,269
control his wrist turning the hip sharply 
to take his balance

7
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:16,002
step in deeply

8
00:00:16,503 --> 00:00:18,923
as you do so control Uke´s wrist and elbow

9
00:00:19,224 --> 00:00:21,334
placing him down directly in front of you, 

10
00:00:21,335 --> 00:00:24,208
come around placing his shoulder 
in between you knees,

11
00:00:24,209 --> 00:00:26,480
controlling his wrist tightly against the body,

12
00:00:26,481 --> 00:00:28,800
turn the body towards his head for the pin.

